# A registry read is served from the bare name's tree, so a confined tenant
# reads the default tenant's catalog.
MODULE: DisclosureStaysInTenantReadsRequestedName
TARGET: DisclosureStaysInTenant
CLASS: Invariant
SUMMARY: a schema read is served from the unresolved name
PERTURBS: Act

--- FIND
                 /\ disclosed' = disclosed \cup {<<c, t>>}
--- REPLACE
                 /\ disclosed' = disclosed \cup {<<c, req.n>>}
--- END
